---
title: Sequence 4 - POST /api/patients/{patient}/visits (Create Visit)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Doctor Client
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant MW as Auth + Role Middleware
    participant Policy as VisitPolicy
    participant Service as VisitService
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>API: POST /api/patients/{patient}/visits {date, notes}
    API->>MW: Verify Sanctum token
    MW-->>API: Authenticated
    API->>API: Resolve Patient via route model binding
    API->>Policy: authorize('create', [Visit, patient])
    alt pacijent attempts to create visit
        Policy-->>API: Denied
        API-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    else doktor or admin
        Policy-->>API: Allowed
        API->>Service: createVisit(patient, authenticatedDoctor, validatedData)
        Service->>DB: INSERT INTO visits {patient_id, doctor_id, date, notes}
        DB-->>Service: Visit record
        Service->>DB: SELECT user where id = doctor_id
        DB-->>Service: Doctor user
        Service-->>API: Visit with doctor
        API-->>Client: 201 VisitResource JSON
    end
